moveit_core, moveit_ros_occupancy_map_monitor: accept octomap 1.10

find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.10.0): ROS Jazzy's own octomap is 1.9.8;
this tree's octomap component (which fcl is built with too) is 1.10.0, whose
octomap/OcTree API MoveIt uses unchanged ("Could not find a configuration
file for package octomap that is compatible with requested version range
1.9.7...<1.10.0"). Accept 1.9.7 up to 1.10.x.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
diff --git a/moveit_core/CMakeLists.txt b/moveit_core/CMakeLists.txt
index ca30488..22ac38c 100644
--- a/moveit_core/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/moveit_core/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ find_package(kdl_parser REQUIRED)
 find_package(moveit_msgs REQUIRED)
 # Enforce system version liboctomap-dev
 # https://github.com/moveit/moveit2/issues/2862
-find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.10.0 REQUIRED)
+find_package(octomap 1.9.7...<1.11.0 REQUIRED)
 find_package(octomap_msgs REQUIRED)
 find_package(osqp REQUIRED)
 find_package(pluginlib REQUIRED)
